---
## Goal
- Complete Multiplayer Competitive Mode track (Phases 2–5) and start Adaptive Difficulty Engine track (Phases 1–2) using TDD.

## Constraints & Preferences
- Follow autonomous prompt rules: commit after each task, never wait for human input, use --yes/--no-interactive flags.
- Maintain >80% test coverage; prefer mock-based testing for WebSocket due to ESM/CJS Jest issues.
- All UI components must fit 390×844 mobile viewport with 44px minimum touch targets.

## Progress
### Done
- Phase 2 Room Management: room-manager.ts (98.47%), LobbyScreen.tsx (95.94%), ws-server room integration (89.13%)
- Phase 3 Game State Synchronization: game-session.ts (98.29%), useMultiplayerGameState.ts (100%), MultiplayerGameWrapper.tsx (86.51%)
- Phase 4 Scoring: scoring-engine.ts (100%), ScoreboardOverlay.tsx (100%), PodiumScreen.tsx (100%)
- Phase 5 Integration & Polish: mobile viewport tests, performance benchmarks (all targets met: scoring <10ms, session <50ms, room ops <10ms)
- Phase 1 Adaptive Difficulty: types/adaptive-difficulty.ts (100%), usePerformanceMetrics.ts (97.46%), registerDifficultyParams.ts (100%)
- Documentation: Updated plan.md, tech-debt.md, lessons-learned.md for all completed phases with checkpoint commits and git notes

### In Progress
- Phase 2 Adaptive Difficulty: adjustment-engine.ts implementation complete; tests failing because EMA needs multiple high/low scores to cross thresholds—fixing test expectations now

### Blocked
- (none)

## Key Decisions
- Continued existing Multiplayer track instead of creating new tech-debt track because it was the most mature planned track with Phase 1 already complete.
- Used server-authoritative game state with 20Hz tick rather than client-side prediction for simplicity in this MVP.
- Implemented optimistic UI in useMultiplayerGameState with rollback on rejection rather than waiting for server confirmation.
- Chose non-linear speed normalization: <1s = 100pts, exponential decay thereafter.
- EMA smoothing factor α=0.3 with cycle size of 5 responses to avoid jittery difficulty changes.

## Next Steps
1. Fix adjustment-engine.test.ts expectations to account for EMA smoothing requiring multiple calls.
2. Run full test suite and build verification for Adaptive Difficulty Phase 2.
3. Update plan.md, tech-debt.md, lessons-learned.md and create checkpoint commit with git notes.
4. Continue to Phase 3 (Game Integration) if user requests continuation.

## Critical Context
- EMA score starts at 50 (neutral); single high/low score won't immediately cross 80/40 thresholds due to α=0.3 smoothing. Tests must feed multiple scores.
- WebSocket module (`ws`) requires `jest.mock('ws', ...)` in any test file importing ws-server.ts; real WebSocket connections fail in Jest.
- Build fails on `?? false` when left side is a boolean comparison (`gameState?.status === 'playing' ?? false` is unreachable).
- Mobile touch targets below 44px were found in LobbyScreen (start/leave buttons at 36px); fixed with `min-h-11` class.
- All performance benchmarks passed: 1000 scoring ops in 6ms, 100 game session ops in 2ms, 100 room ops in 3ms.

## Relevant Files
- src/lib/multiplayer/room-manager.ts: Server-side room lifecycle and operations
- src/lib/multiplayer/ws-server.ts: WebSocket server with heartbeat and room message handlers
- src/lib/multiplayer/game-session.ts: Server-authoritative game state machine with 20Hz tick
- src/hooks/useMultiplayerGameState.ts: Client-side state consumer with optimistic UI
- src/components/multiplayer/LobbyScreen.tsx: Create/join room UI with host controls
- src/components/multiplayer/ScoreboardOverlay.tsx: Real-time animated scoreboard
- src/components/multiplayer/PodiumScreen.tsx: End-of-game rankings with XP bonuses
- src/lib/multiplayer/scoring-engine.ts: Anti-cheat score calculation with combo/time bonuses
- src/hooks/usePerformanceMetrics.ts: Rolling window metrics hook (20 responses, weighted composite)
- src/lib/adaptive-difficulty/registerDifficultyParams.ts: Module-level registry for game difficulty params
- src/lib/adaptive-difficulty/adjustment-engine.ts: EMA-based parameter adjuster (α=0.3, ±15% cap)
- conductor/tracks/multiplayer_competitive_mode_20260423/plan.md: Multiplayer track plan (Phases 1–5 complete)
- conductor/tracks/adaptive_difficulty_engine_20260423/plan.md: Adaptive Difficulty plan (Phase 1 complete, Phase 2 in progress)
